#: ui/main.qml:26
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Time-based features such as Night Light and dynamic wallpapers can be "
"synchronized with the day-night cycle. Choose your preferred cycle here."
msgstr ""
"እንደ የሌሊት ብርሃን እና ተለዋዋጭ ዋልፔፐሮች ያሉ በጊዜ ላይ የተመሰረቱ ባህሪያት፣ ከቀንና ሌሊት ዑደት ጋር ሊጣጣሙ "
"ይችላሉ። የሚመርጡትን ዑደት እዚህ ይምረጡ።"

#: ui/main.qml:63
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@label:listbox part of a sentence: 'Determine sunrise and sunset times "
"[based on]'"
msgid "Determine sunrise and sunset times:"
msgstr "የፀሐይ መውጫ እና መጥለቂያ ጊዜዎችን ይወስኑ፦"

#: ui/main.qml:68
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@item:inlistbox part of a sentence: 'Determine sunrise and sunset times'"
msgid "Based on device's location"
msgstr "በመሣሪያው መገኛ ላይ በመመስረት"

#: ui/main.qml:69
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@item:inlistbox part of a sentence: 'Determine sunrise and sunset times'"
msgid "Using custom times"
msgstr "ብጁ ሰዓቶችን በመጠቀም"

#: ui/main.qml:84
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Sunrise:"
msgstr "ፀሐይ መውጫ፦"

#: ui/main.qml:101
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Sunset:"
msgstr "ፀሐይ መጥለቅ፦"

#: ui/main.qml:117
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Transition duration:"
msgstr "የሽግግር ቆይታ፦"

#: ui/main.qml:122
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item:valuesuffix transition duration"
msgid "%1 minute"
msgid_plural "%1 minutes"
msgstr[0] "%1 ደቂቃ"
msgstr[1] "%1 ደቂቃዎች"

#: ui/main.qml:140
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The <application>GeoClue2</application> service will be used to periodically "
"update the device's location using GPS or cell tower triangulation if "
"available, or else by sending its IP address to <link url='https://geoip.com/"
"privacy/'>GeoIP</link>."
msgstr ""
"የ <application>GeoClue2</application> አገልግሎት፣ የሚቻል ከሆነ በጂፒኤስ (GPS) ወይም በሞባይል "
"ማማዎች አማካኝነት (triangulation)፣ አለበለዚያም የአይፒ (IP) አድራሻውን ወደ <link url='https://"
"geoip.com/privacy/'>GeoIP</link> በመላክ፣ የመሳሪያውን መገኛ ቦታ በየጊዜው ለማዘመን ጥቅም ላይ "
"ይውላል።"

#: ui/main.qml:141
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The <application>%1</application> service will be used to periodically "
"update the device's location. Please open a bug report at <link url='https://"
"bugs.kde.org'>https://bugs.kde.org</link> asking KDE developers to write a "
"detailed description of what this service will do."
msgstr ""
"የ <application>%1</application> አገልግሎት የመሳሪያውን መገኛ ቦታ በየጊዜው ለማዘመን ጥቅም ላይ "
"ይውላል። እባክዎ በ <link url='https://bugs.kde.org'>https://bugs.kde.org</link> ላይ "
"የሳንካ ሪፖርት (bug report) በመክፈት፣ ይህ አገልግሎት ምን እንደሚሰራ ዝርዝር መግለጫ እንዲሰጡ የKDE "
"አልሚዎችን ይጠይቁ።"

#: ui/main.qml:144
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Automatically detect location"
msgstr "አካባቢን በራስ-ሰር ፈልግ"

#: ui/main.qml:167
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Use manual location:"
msgstr "መገኛውን (location) በእጅ ያስገቡ፦"

#: ui/main.qml:179
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Latitude:"
msgstr "ኬክሮስ፦"

#: ui/main.qml:199
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Longitude:"
msgstr "ኬንትሮስ፦"

#: ui/SunPath.qml:52
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip; the variables are times of day, e.g. 07:30"
msgid "Sunrise starts at %1 and ends at %2"
msgstr "ፀሐይ መውጣት በ%1 ይጀምራል፤ በ%2ም ያበቃል።"

#: ui/SunPath.qml:57
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Sunrise"
msgstr "ፀሐይ መውጫ"

#: ui/SunPath.qml:77
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip; the variables are times of day, e.g. 07:30"
msgid "Sunset starts at %1 and ends at %2"
msgstr "ፀሐይ መጥለቅ በ%1 ይጀምራል፤ በ%2ም ያበቃል።"

#: ui/SunPath.qml:82
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Sunset"
msgstr "ፀሐይ መጥለቅ"

#: ui/SunPath.qml:107
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Sunrise and sunset times cannot be determined at your location due to polar "
"day. Choose custom times instead."
msgstr ""
"የፀሐይ መውጫና መግቢያ ሰዓቶች በዋልታዊ ቀን ምክንያት በአካባቢዎ ሊወሰኑ አይችሉም። እባክዎ በምትኩ ብጁ ሰዓቶችን "
"ይምረጡ።"

#: ui/SunPath.qml:109
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Sunrise and sunset times cannot be determined at your location due to polar "
"night. Choose custom times instead."
msgstr ""
"በዋልታዊ ሌሊት ምክንያት የፀሐይ መውጫና መግቢያ ሰዓቶች በአካባቢዎ ሊወሰኑ አይችሉም። እባክዎ በምትኩ ብጁ ሰዓቶችን "
"ይምረጡ።"

#: ui/SunPath.qml:111
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Sunrise and sunset times cannot be reliably determined at your location. "
"Choose custom times instead."
msgstr ""
"በአካባቢዎ የፀሐይ መውጫ እና የፀሐይ መጥለቂያ ጊዜዎችን በእርግጠኝነት መወሰን አይቻልም።  እባክዎ በምትኩ ብጁ ሰዓቶችን "
"ይምረጡ።"

#: ui/TimeField.qml:31
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Time separator between hours and minutes"
msgid ":"
msgstr ":"

